@startuml
title Feature 002 - Google Sheets Guided Notes (DRAFT)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
actor Teacher
actor Student
component "Teacher Browser\nPassword + Sheets URL\nManual writeback / status" as TB
component "Student Browser\nNo Google account" as SB
package "Existing Local Backend" {
  component "Role / Session Validation" as Auth
  component "Activity / Question Management\nWAITING / ANSWERING / RESULTS / COMPLETED" as Activity
  component "Submission Management\nServer order / one per group-question" as Quiz
  component "Role-filtered Synchronization" as Sync
  component "Guided Notes\nValidate all supported sheets\nDynamic placeholder mapping" as Notes
  component "Writeback Coordination\nImmutable closed-winner snapshot\nOne operation per activity\nPreflight / reconcile / verify" as Write
  component "Google Sheets Access\nBackend service identity only" as Access
  database "Runtime Store\nActivity / source / locations\nSessions / submissions\nOperation / verified evidence" as Store
}
cloud "Google Sheets API\nOriginal authorized spreadsheet" as Google
artifact "Service Account credential\nOutside repository\nNever sent to browsers" as Cred
Teacher --> TB
Student --> SB
TB --> Auth : teacher operations
SB --> Auth : claim / resume / submit
Auth --> Activity
Auth --> Quiz
Auth --> Notes : prepare (teacher only)
Auth --> Write : manual writeback (teacher only)
Activity --> Store
Quiz --> Store
Activity --> Sync
Quiz --> Sync
Sync --> Store
Sync --> TB : teacher view
Sync --> SB : own data before close\nclosed results after close
Notes --> Store : valid groups + complete source validation\nthen commit; no validated-source draft
Notes --> Access : read all supported GRID sheets\nincluding hidden sheets
note bottom of Notes
  Reject answer markers with partial-character formatting.
  Known non-editable source / answer cells: reject preparation.
  Unknown write permission: allow valid source, warn teacher.
  Permission checks never write test values.
  Preserve whole-cell formatting and non-answer rich text.
end note
Write --> Store : snapshot / operation / evidence
Write --> Access : check original targets\nwrite eligible values / read back
Access --> Cred : backend authentication
Access --> Google : read / write existing authorized source
note bottom of Google
  Owner shares each source with service identity.
  Editor and protected-range permissions still apply.
  External edits may race with preflight: no lock implied.
end note
note bottom of Write
  Detected conflict: stop unsent changes.
  Unknown result: retain snapshot, reconcile before retry.
  Structure checks use imported mapping + this activity's
  evidence / pending operation, not raw markers alone.
  No automatic writeback or forced overwrite.
  Cloud waiting never decides quiz rank or close.
end note
note bottom of Store
  One in-memory activity; restart may clear local state.
  Restart does not undo remote answers.
  Source reuse requires restored placeholders or fresh template.
end note
legend bottom
  Draft for spec.md US1-US4 / FR-001..021.
  No Excel formal flow. Feature 001 artifacts remain historical.
  Prior Specify / cross-group confirmation retained: 2026-11-18.
  Clarify integrated version approved by user: 2026-11-18.
endlegend
@enduml
